OL,3,GNEWSASurvivors 'betrayed' after rapist
OL,4,Afled to Pakistan while on bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree women who were sexually abused by
OL,7,Fa serial rapist have said they feel
OL,8,F"betrayed" and "frustrated" after their
OL,9,Fattacker fled to Pakistan while on
OL,10,Fbail.
OL,12,FAmar Ilyas, 41, was convicted of 20
OL,13,Fsexual offences against five girls in
OL,14,FSheffield and was sentenced, in his
OL,15,Fabsence, to a minimum of 27 years in
OL,16,Fprison.
OL,18,FOne of his victims told the BBC she had
OL,19,Fassumed his passport would
OL,20,Fautomatically be surrendered after he
OL,21,Fwas charged and said she was "so
OL,22,Fdisappointed in the law".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
