OL,3,GNEWSASurvivors 'betrayed' after rapist
OL,4,Afled to Pakistan while on bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said "decisions on bail
OL,7,Frestrictions are a matter for the
OL,8,Findependent judiciary", while the
OL,9,FNational Crime Agency (NCA) said it was
OL,10,F"making every effort to ensure Ilyas is
OL,11,Fbrought before the court".
